      {
        "value": "Gradix documentation",
        "count": 1
      },
      {
        "value": "Gradix lets Collector Crypt holders swap their tokenized graded Pokémon cards directly, without selling first. Each card is a Metaplex programmable NFT on Solana backed by a graded card in Collector Crypt's vault.",
        "count": 1
      },
      {
        "value": "A completed swap costs 1 USDC per side. All swap fees buy back and burn $GRADIX once a day. Wallets holding at least 1,000,000 $GRADIX pay no fee.",
        "count": 1
      },
      {
        "value": "The owner answers.",
        "count": 1
      },
      {
        "value": "They see the offer with both insured values side by side. They can accept, ignore it, or counter with a new offer the other way.",
        "count": 1
      },
      {
        "value": "Accept settles everything.",
        "count": 1
      },
      {
        "value": "The owner signs one transaction. Both cards and the USDC move in the same instruction, or nothing moves.",
        "count": 1
      },
      {
        "value": "Cancel or expiry.",
        "count": 1
      },
      {
        "value": "Until it is accepted, the bidder can cancel for free. After an expiry, anyone can send the escrow back to the bidder.",
        "count": 1
      },
      {
        "value": "Worked example",
        "count": 1
      },
      {
