      {
        "value": "Collector Crypt is a third party. A change to its collection, metadata or transfer rule set could block new offers or transfers.",
        "count": 1
      },
      {
        "value": "$GRADIX is a token on a bonding curve and can lose all its value. Holding it only removes your swap fee.",
