      {
        "value": "Where does the money for the $GRADIX buyback come from?",
        "count": 2
      },
      {
        "value": "Only from swap fees: 1 USDC per side on each completed swap. There are no emissions and no outside top-ups. If nobody swaps, nothing is bought. Cancelled and expired offers pay nothing.",
        "count": 2
      },
      {
        "value": "Who can change the rules after launch?",
        "count": 2
      },
      {
        "value": "An admin key sets the fee, the treasury account and the $GRADIX waiver, and can pause new offers. The program caps the fee at 10 USDC per side, and an open offer keeps the fee it was made with. The admin key cannot move escrowed cards or USDC, and a pause never blocks cancel or accept.",
